+<H2>
+<FONT SIZE="-1">
+javax.annotation</FONT>
+<BR>
+Annotation Type OverridingMethodsMustInvokeSuper</H2>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE><FONT SIZE="-1">@Documented
+@Target(value=METHOD)
+@Retention(value=RUNTIME)
+</FONT>public @interface <B>OverridingMethodsMustInvokeSuper</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+When this annotation is applied to a method, it indicates that if this method
+ is overridden in a subclass, the overriding method should invoke this method
+ (through method invocation on super).
+<P>
