+<H2>
+<FONT SIZE="-1">
+javax.annotation.meta</FONT>
+<BR>
+Annotation Type TypeQualifierDefault</H2>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE><FONT SIZE="-1">@Documented
+@Target(value=ANNOTATION_TYPE)
+@Retention(value=RUNTIME)
+</FONT>public @interface <B>TypeQualifierDefault</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+This qualifier is applied to an annotation to denote that the annotation
+ defines a default type qualifier that is visible within the scope of the
+ element it is applied to.
+<P>
